@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
title ABAC Policy Engine — Use cases (solo project)
actor "Policy administrator" as Admin
actor "Requesting application\n(doctor / nurse / registrar)" as Client
actor Auditor
rectangle "Console ABAC system" {
  usecase "Load and validate\nJSON policies" as Load
  usecase "Evaluate access\nPERMIT / DENY" as Eval
  usecase "Evaluate batch\nwith worker pool" as Batch
  usecase "Persist audit\nin SQLite" as Audit
  usecase "Export CSV / JSON\nand statistics" as Report
}
Admin --> Load
Client --> Eval
Client --> Batch
Batch ..> Eval : <<include>>
Eval ..> Load : <<precondition>>
Batch ..> Audit : <<include>>
Auditor --> Report
Report ..> Audit : reads records
note bottom of Audit
AuditedEngine persists before returning.
Main core demo can evaluate without audit.
end note
@enduml
